title: Palo Alto: BGP Peers (XML API)
agents: palo_alto_api
catalog: hw/network/palo_alto
license: GPLv3
distribution: kuhn-ruess
description:
 This check monitors the BGP peers of a Palo Alto Networks firewall as read from
 {show routing protocol bgp peer} through the PAN-OS XML API. It reports the
 peer status together with the peer address, peer group and remote AS.

 The service is {OK} while the peer is {established} and goes to the configurable
 monitoring state (default {CRIT}) otherwise.

item:
 The BGP peer name.

discovery:
 One service is created for each BGP peer.
